<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Removes a follower from the active party, sending him back to the party pool. This function will do nothing for plot followers.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Plot followers are the creatures with tags defined by the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/GEN%20FL" title="GEN FL *">GEN_FL_*</a> constants.
</p>
